research: compare L1 raw AI rank 1, market rank 1, market-calibrated P rank 1, and current EV-selected anchor on every one of 10,368 historical OOS races. Hold ticket unit, price sources, partner ranking and bet families fixed; exact dividends, no skip, no thresholds, 2026 sealed. Use one pinned checkout and parallel years; standard free CPU only.

Run2: corrected standard-runner guard only; source and selection definitions unchanged.
